/T (Money laundering, terrorism financing, and proliferation financing pose significant risks to Kenya's financial system, national security, and the integrity of professional services. These crimes increasingly involve international transactions and the exploitation of legitimate professional services. Therefore, accountants must implement robust safeguards to prevent misuse.)
