/T (In Kenya, accountants are classified as Designated Non-Financial Businesses and Professions \(DNFBPs\) under Section 2 of the POCAMLA. The AML/CFT/CPF legal framework applies to accountants in public practice who perform activities listed under Section 48 of POCAMLA on behalf of their client\(s\). Criminals often target these professional services to mask the origin, movement, or ownership of illicit funds through the following activities:)
