/T (Trusts present inherent ML/TF risks because they separate legal ownership from beneficial enjoyment, making it easier to conceal the origin and ownership of assets. Complex trust structures, unclear beneficiaries, and cross-border arrangements can further obscure transparency and increase the likelihood of misuse for laundering illicit proceeds or facilitating terrorist financing.)
/E (Trusts present inherent ML/TF risks because they separate legal ownership from beneficial enjoyment, making it easier to conceal the origin and ownership of assets. Complex trust structures, unclear beneficiaries, and cross-border arrangements can further obscure transparency and increase the likelihood of misuse for laundering illicit proceeds or facilitating terrorist financing.)
/Pg 16 0 R
>>
endobj
